\subsection{Research attempt}
\paragraph{Model, date and investigated scope.}
OpenAI GPT-6 Astra (configured model \texttt{gpt-6-astra}), ultra reasoning; generated 11 October 2026. Constructs a linear gauge slice and an explicit second-order obstruction, showing why a slice alone does not supply perturbation theory.

\paragraph{Sources and literature check.}
